%N A288030 Number of minimal edge covers in the grid graph P_3 X P_n.
%H A288030 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A288030/b288030.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..200</a>
%H A288030 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/GridGraph.html">Grid Graph</a>.
